        <h3>Where November 28 Fell in Each Run</h3>
        <p>The weeks split three ways:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>{{N_FIRST}} songs were in their first week at number one: "Photograph," "I Can Help," "That's the Way (I Like It)" and "No More Tears (Enough Is Enough)."</li>
          <li>{{N_MID}} were in the middle of a longer run: "I Think I Love You," "Tonight's the Night (Gonna Be Alright)" and "You Light Up My Life."</li>
          <li>Three were in the last week of their run: "Theme from Shaft," "I Can See Clearly Now" and "MacArthur Park."</li>
        </ul>

